# 10xdevs

A student portfolio platform. Students build a profile and showcase their **projects, publications, achievements, experience, skills and certifications**. Faculty and admins can search students, and admins can manage users.

This is a monorepo with two apps:

| Folder | What it is |
|---|---|
| `frontend/` | Frontend: React + Vite single-page app |
| `backend/` | Backend: Node.js + Express REST API with MongoDB |

