## Project structure

```
.
├── backend/
│   ├── server.js              # Entry point: loads env, connects DB, starts server
│   ├── app.js                 # Express app: helmet, CORS, rate limits, routes
│   ├── config/db.js           # MongoDB connection
│   ├── controllers/           # Request handlers (auth, admin, dashboard, portfolio/*)
│   │   └── portfolio/crudFactory.js   # Reusable CRUD controller scoped to the owner
│   ├── middleware/
│   │   ├── auth.js            # protect (verify JWT) and restrictTo(roles)
│   │   ├── validate.js        # Request body validation
│   │   └── errorHandler.js
│   ├── models/                # User, UserProfile, Project, Publication, Achievement,
│   │                          # Experience, Skill, Certification, PasswordResetOtp
│   ├── routes/                # Route definitions (portfolio/* for each section)
│   ├── utils/                 # jwt.js, email.js, imagekit.js, response.js
│   └── .env.example
└── 10xdevss/
    ├── src/
    │   ├── authentication/api.js   # Axios instance, token storage, all API calls
    │   ├── context/AuthContext.jsx # Session state (user, profile, role)
    │   ├── routes/                 # ProtectedRoute, AdminProtectedRoute, FacultyAdminProtectedRoute
    │   ├── pages/                  # auth, portfolio, profile, settings, admin, faculty
    │   ├── components/             # Navbar, Layout, cards, dashboard widgets
    │   ├── hooks/useImageKitUpload.js
    │   ├── styles/                 # Per-page and per-component CSS
    │   └── App.jsx                 # Route table
    ├── public/                     # Logos and Lottie animations
    └── .env.example
```

